          "text": "Description: On August 2, 1984, at 2:04 a.m., a witness will spot for 3 seconds an object with a cylindrical shape. The object is stationary then starts to move. An observation through binoculars allows him to see a yellow ramp on the axis of the cylinder and parallel to the direction of movement. No other information could be gathered about this phenomenon.",
